  <section><div class="container"><div class="kicker reveal">My Role</div><h2 class="section-title reveal">From implementation to Play Store preparation</h2><p class="section-copy reveal">Developing the Flutter application, integrating platform services, shaping the product experience, preparing store assets and handling privacy/release requirements.</p></div></section>
